Opt-in feature counter LD_FEAT_LOG=1: which of PR #6 (one-channel crossbar), #305 (texture gamma) and #304 (SET_SHADER_PACKER output sRGB) KZ3 uses.

Per sampled unit of each draw it counts one-channel formats (base 0x90-0x94, 0x9C) with a non-identity crossbar, non-zero TEXTURE_ADDRESS gamma fields (with the alpha bit and the source-signed filter bits apart), keyed by format, remap, zalias kind and colour target; and per draw the non-zero values of SET_SHADER_PACKER at 0x1FEC (the PR's address) and 0x1FBC (patch 2009's). `[feat]` table every 40,000 draws. No behaviour change.

--- a/libs/video/rsx_live_draw.c
+++ b/libs/video/rsx_live_draw.c
